@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@bearerToken = substitua-por-jwt-com-claim-clientId

### CA01, RF01-RF03 -> esperado: 200 OK com agendamentos do aluno
GET {{baseUrl}}/schedulings
Authorization: Bearer {{bearerToken}}

### CA07, FE02 -> esperado: 401 Unauthorized sem token
GET {{baseUrl}}/schedulings
